# Architecture & Project Structure

## Monorepo Layout

```
kame-ops/
├── apps/
│   └── web/                    # Next.js app (dashboard)
├── packages/
│   ├── database/               # Shared Drizzle (when extracted)
│   ├── ui/
│   ├── types/
│   ├── utils/
│   ├── config/
│   └── emails/
├── docs/
└── scripts/                    # Migration from pay-credit-cards CLI
```

## Feature-Based Architecture

Organize code under `apps/web/src/features/`. Credit cards is **one module** among others.

```
src/features/
├── dashboard/
│   ├── auth/                   # Auth pages (wraps shared auth)
│   ├── overview/               # Home dashboard
│   ├── credit-cards/           # ⭐ CC sub-module (SOA, dues, cards CRUD)
│   ├── reminders/              # Generic reminder engine UI
│   ├── automations/            # Cron jobs, run logs
│   ├── integrations/           # Gmail, Telegram, Slack, Calendar
│   ├── receipts/               # Upload, AI validation, mark paid
│   ├── analytics/              # Spending charts (CC module data)
│   └── settings/               # Profile, notifications prefs
└── shared/
    └── auth/                   # LoginForm, session hooks (shared)
```

## App Directory = Routes Only

`apps/web/src/app/` contains only `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, API `route.ts`. Pages import from `@/features/...`.

Example routes:

```
app/
├── (auth)/login, register, ...
├── (dashboard)/
│   ├── page.tsx                    # Overview
│   ├── credit-cards/               # List, detail, SOA runs
│   ├── reminders/
│   ├── automations/
│   ├── integrations/
│   ├── receipts/
│   └── settings/
└── api/
    ├── trpc/[trpc]/route.ts
    ├── webhooks/telegram/route.ts  # Telegram bot webhook
    └── cron/[job]/route.ts         # Supabase Cron HTTP targets
```

## Unidirectional Flow

```
app/ → features/ → shared (components, lib, hooks, server)
features/ → shared only (NO cross-feature imports)
shared/ → cannot import features/ or app/
```

Compose modules in pages:

```typescript
// ✅ app/(dashboard)/page.tsx
import { OverviewStats } from '@/features/dashboard/overview/components/OverviewStats';
import { UpcomingReminders } from '@/features/dashboard/reminders/components/UpcomingReminders';

// ❌ features/dashboard/credit-cards importing reminders feature
```

## Server Layout

```
src/server/
├── trpc.ts
├── routers/
│   ├── _app.ts
│   ├── credit-cards.ts
│   ├── soa.ts
│   ├── reminders.ts
│   ├── automations.ts
│   ├── integrations.ts
│   └── receipts.ts
├── services/
│   ├── credit-card.service.ts
│   ├── soa.service.ts              # SOA pipeline (lib/soa/run + summary PDF)
│   ├── reminder.service.ts         # Due reminders (native send + default automation seed)
│   ├── send-due-reminders.service.ts
│   ├── notification.service.ts     # Telegram/Slack outbound
│   ├── reminder-log.service.ts     # reminder_logs idempotency
│   ├── soa-workdir.service.ts      # Per-user SOA workdir + OAuth env
│   ├── mark-paid.service.ts        # Native mark paid/unpaid/receipt
│   ├── automation.service.ts       # automation_jobs CRUD + dispatch
│   ├── gmail.service.ts
│   ├── receipt.service.ts
│   ├── receipt-validation.service.ts
│   └── storage.service.ts
└── app/api/cron/dispatch/          # Supabase pg_cron → dispatchDueJobs()
```

## Credit Cards Module Boundaries

| Belongs in CC module | Belongs in platform |
| -------------------- | ------------------- |
| Card CRUD, bank issuer config | User auth, settings |
| SOA run UI, transaction display | Generic reminders table |
| Due entries for cards | Automation scheduler |
| Mark paid for card cycles | Integration OAuth storage |
| Bank-specific parsers | Notification channel routing |

Platform reminders reference CC dues via `relatedEntityType: 'credit_card'` + `relatedEntityId`.

## Mobile Readiness

- Business logic in services + tRPC only
- Shared DTOs in `packages/types` when stable
- No web-only assumptions in services

See `@docs/architecture/mobile-readiness.md` and rule `17-mobile-readiness.mdc`.
